      "text": "the Lord to bring forth fulness of gospel from Gentiles unto Israel, D&C 14:10 (19:27; 90:9; 107:33, 97). Gentiles to be stirred up unto repentance, D&C 18:6. Twelve called to declare gospel, both to Gentile and Jew, D&C 18:26–27. Book of Mormon is the Lord’s word to Gentile, D&C 19:27. there shall be great work among Gentiles, D&C 35:7. abominations of Gentiles to be manifest, D&C 35:7. the Lord to consecrate riches of Gentiles unto poor of Israel, D&C 42:39. Gentiles to seek everlasting covenant, D&C 45:9. times of Gentiles, D&C 45:25, 28, 30. Saints to buy land unto line running directly between Jew and Gentile, D&C 57:4. elders to be light unto Gentiles, D&C 86:11. remnants of slaves left in land shall vex Gentiles, D&C 87:5. go forth among Gentiles for last time, D&C 88:84. word to go forth unto Gentiles first, D&C 90:9 (107:33–35, 97; 133:8). Seventy are especial witnesses unto Gentiles, D&C 107:25. Saints identified with Gentiles, D&C 109:60. Gentiles to come to exaltation of Zion, D&C 124:9. those among Gentiles should flee to Zion, D&C 133:12.",
